# The repository stores text with LF, and several guards read files back off
# disk and compare them byte for byte: the migration lineage hashes every SQL
# file installed live, and the commission-terms test asserts on exact SQL
# fragments. On a Windows checkout core.autocrlf rewrote those same files to
# CRLF on their way to the working tree, so the bytes on disk stopped matching
# the bytes that were committed and both guards failed for a difference that
# does not exist in the repository.
#
# Pinning the working tree to LF makes what a test reads the same as what was
# committed, on every machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary formats must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
